MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=0
RELEASE_VERSION=0
PRERELEASE=1
DEV_VERSION=2
GM=0
DESCRIPTION=stamp_version_release_date.sh: after the locked plus mirrored-entries pass, walk every version/entries/**/*.ver (including preproduction */ trees that finalize does not copy into version/locked) and append merge-day RELEASE_DATE= when the key is still missing, so Version lock on merge applies dates to preproduction-only rows.
